      <p source="#source-364-411"><seg source="#source-364-376">旅は泪よ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-376-394"><rb>故里</rb><rt>クニ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-394-411">はまだかよ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-411-446"><seg source="#source-411-446">その日その日の夢になく</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-446-484"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-452-473"><rb>運命</rb><rt>サダメ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-473-484">に弱い</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-484-518"><seg source="#source-484-518">我は悲しい渡り鳥</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-518-553"><seg source="#source-518-553">旅は夢かよ春も逝くかよ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-553-582"><seg source="#source-553-582">柳の雨に濡れて泣く</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-582-605"><seg source="#source-582-605">燕でないが</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-605-637"><seg source="#source-605-637">我も悲しい渡り鳥</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-637-710" style="padding-inline-start: 17em">
        <p source="#source-661-710"><seg source="#source-661-664">―</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-664-695" corresp="#source-666-695"><seg source="#source-664-666">10</seg></hi><seg source="#source-695-710">・５・４―</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
